ically generated for this purpose. To enable adding cells, the class’ user should","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"set the addButtonItem property of the section to a valid UIBarButtonItem, the section then","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"will automatically add new items when the button is tapped.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scarrayofitemssection","fragments":[{"text":"SCArrayOfItemsSection","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"SCArrayOfItemsSection"}}}